                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Nestled in a quiet corner, this Japanese eatery offers a cosy ambience. The dishes are crafted with fresh, high-quality ingredients, and the generous portions make it a delight for both the eyes and the palate. The friendly and attentive staff add to the welcoming experience. For an extra treat, try to snag a counter seat and watch the chef\u0027s masterful techniques in action—it’s like dinner and a show! With its excellent food and reasonable prices, this spot is truly great value for money and a must-visit for lovers of Japanese cuisine.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
