                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I swear... this is one of the best Japanese restaurants I\u0027ve ever been to.  It\u0027s small and cozy with very fresh seafood.  Tonight, I had the donburi with fish roe, fresh crab meat, scallops \u0026 crab tamale, veggies with sesame sauce and deep fried oysters.  Everything was to die for!  I felt like I was tasting the ocean.  The seafood was THAT fresh and tasty.  Pretty sure I\u0027ll return before I leave Taipei.  Just an amazing family run restaurant!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
